## Maximal detail + Coverage + Replacement + Outcome (HARD)

DECOMPOSE = **максимально подробная** нарезка **по coverage** (FR/AC/Stages/Replacement), не по числу файлов. Артефакты **без** telegraph/200-line economy. Chat MAY be brief.

**Maximal detail ≠ maximal step count.** Полнота внутри `sNN` + index coverage; target band **5–8** sNN (L3/L4 ≤9). Канон: @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc §3a.

**Index REQUIRED:** `## Requirements coverage` · `## Stages coverage` · `## Outcome map` · `## Replacement cleanup` (A|B|C|**I**).  
**Coverage rubric / anti-dilution / wire ladder / granularity / Outcome preserve / Replacement cleanup:** канон в @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc + @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-legacy-fallback-cleanup.mdc — **не дублировать** таблицы здесь; FAIL-условия — в Gates.

**Per-step:** `plan_contract` · delta layer · 2–4 cp · `deletes` · `tdd` · Core(4) ∪ situational ≤6 · lean interfaces (без тел методов).

